{:event/actor "seb" :event/at #inst "2026-07-29T17:40:24.783Z" :event/body {:fact/path [:summary] :fact/value "An event whose self-declared :event/at is in the future makes evolve evaluate the graph at that future instant, so :elapsed-since passes and any sticky stage it gates is locked in permanently at real now. Confirmed: a P365D guard reaches in 2026 from one 2099-dated event. No retraction undoes a sticky reach. ADR 0012 answers backdating only; this is forward-dating and it changes derivation rather than merely misleading a reader. Needs an ADR: clamp evolve's now, require a witnessed clock for sticky time guards, or flag future-dated events in a lens."} :event/parents #{"sha256-5a9aa63146aba9de4780a86cb8c65871b7bfcd4c2a939c428a549a5f9a865c06"} :event/ticket #uuid "e63909ba-7cb9-49e4-98a7-e934e990f290" :event/type :fact/assert}